       <TDFORMAT>U1</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>SQL Cockpit - Rapid Report Generator Template Wizard</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>Using the template wizard you can generate a RRG ABAP Class  for the</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>current SELECT statement.</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>You can move between the steps by using &lt;ZH&gt;Next&lt;/&gt; and &lt;ZH&gt;Back&lt;/&gt;  or</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>use the explicit step link.</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>On the last step you get a summary and you can start the generation with</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>the function &lt;ZH&gt;Complete.&lt;/&gt;</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
